3e","ts":"1620645553.221300","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: クルト (食品)","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"クルト (食品)","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88_(%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81)","text":"クルート（ラテン文字: Qurut、タジク語: қурут、キルギス語: курут、[qurút]、トルコ語: kurut、アゼルバイジャン語: qurut）、クルト (カザフ語: құрт、[qʊrt]、タタール語: qort、[qʊrt]、ペルシア語: لچ‎ ラッチまたはکشک キャシュク、モンゴル語: ааруул,ᠠᠭᠠᠷᠤᠤᠯ アールール [ɑːrʊɮ]）は主に中央アジアで食されているチーズの一種である。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Qurut_tajikistan.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88_(%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81)","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88_(%E9%A3%9F%E5%93%81)"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g7/A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52faf9b1-f74f-43d4-8ecb-63a74e1a5d57","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"珍しく精神的に健康なのでみそ汁作って食べるなどしている","ts":"1620645394.218100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U843L486L"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z/xrh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccbad186-9b7e-493c-80d2-70dcec625e06","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あれかな、クルトみたいになるのかな(乙嫁語り9巻あとがき参照)","ts":"1620644478.217000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YaX2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62D29980-8B58-4A78-8535-9A8F810526B8","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"モッツァレラチーズのぬか漬けはお互いの良さを消しあっていて微妙... な仕上がりとなりました。\nが、なぜかもう一個と手が伸びてしまう癖がなんとも言えないです。","ts":"1620643831.215000","files":[{"id":"F0223A45UHW","created":1620643561,"timestamp":1620643561,"name":"iOS の画像.jpg","title":"iOS の画像","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JP